================================================================================
Derived and inspired work
================================================================================

Headroom
  Copyright 2025 Headroom Contributors
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  https://github.com/chopratejas/headroom

  Ogham's design is substantially derived from Headroom: the reversible
  CCR (Content-Compress-Retrieve) store and marker scheme, content-type
  routing, and the SmartCrusher and LogStripper compressor designs
  originate there. The Rust implementation in this repository was written
  independently for Ogham.

Microsoft LLMLingua / LLMLingua-2 / LongLLMLingua
  https://llmlingua.com
  Semantic scoring and perplexity-based compression concepts.

Additional inspiration: RTK (Rust Token Killer), Claw Compactor,
steno/deemuk, llm-token-saver-rs, sqz, TOON, and the research literature
on selective context and agent context optimization (SAC, Selective
Context, Acon).

